  {
    "reviewTitle": "Beyond My Expectations",
    "reviewDescription": "I usually don't leave reviews, but these headphones were so amazing that I just had to make sure others considering them knew about their quality. I am quite specific in my headphones, and I do not settle for ones that do not have what I need; however, this pair has everything that I was looking for: small stems for small ear canals (which is a struggle to find), a great bass boost which exceeded my expectations, and overall just great quality. The sounds that these earbuds make are of a quality that is beyond what they are asking for the price. The battery life lasts a really long time, around about 30 hours as described. These earbuds also automatically connect to the last device that they paired with, making it simple and fast for me to connect them. Comfortable when sitting in my ear too! The case is really durable too - not flimsy like other cases. It hinges smoothly and snaps in place when closing with the magnet. There is also a light on the inside that shows you roughly how much battery life the case has left, which was a feature that I enjoy. One thing that I do not mind but should be considered is that these earbuds do not completely block out surrounding sound when off, but they do when on. Overall, this product is worth the money! Totally recommend!",
